{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_block_level_function_declaration", "label": "Block-level function declaration", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A function declaration inside a block is not top-level hoisting. Strict mode scopes it to that block; sloppy mode is Annex B and engine-dependent."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_strict_mode_block_functions", "label": "Strict-mode block functions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In strict mode (every module and class body) block-level function declarations hoist to the top of that block and do not exist outside it."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_annex_b_sloppy_block_functions", "label": "Annex B sloppy-mode block functions", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Non-strict block function declarations behave strangely and differ across Chrome, Firefox and Safari. Scope setup still runs even if the if body never executes."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_prefer_const_function_expression", "label": "Prefer const-assigned function expressions in blocks", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Never write a function declaration inside a block. Assign a function expression to let or const so the binding is exactly where you wrote it in every engine."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_parameter_list_tdz", "label": "Parameter list TDZ", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The parameter list is its own scope and initialises left to right. A default that reads a later parameter throws Cannot access before initialization."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_parameter_scope_parent", "label": "Parameter scope is parent of body", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Default initialisers run in the parameter scope, a parent of the body. Body functions and even var bindings are not visible; the error is X is not defined, not a TDZ access."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_var_shadows_parameter", "label": "var shadowing a parameter", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A var of the same name in the body is a separate binding. A closure created in a default captures the parameter, never the body's var."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_prefer_const_function_expression", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_block_level_function_declaration", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_strict_mode_block_functions", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_block_level_function_declaration", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_annex_b_sloppy_block_functions", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_block_level_function_declaration", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_parameter_scope_parent", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_parameter_list_tdz", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_var_shadows_parameter", "target": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_3_functions_08_hoisting_and_tdz_05_block_functions_and_parameters_parameter_scope_parent", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-3-functions/08-hoisting-and-tdz/05-block-functions-and-parameters.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": []}